":[],"type":{"id":672275,"node_id":"IT_kwDOAGhwUs4ACkIT","name":"Bug","description":"An unexpected problem or behavior","color":"red","created_at":"2024-01-25T10:21:54Z","updated_at":"2024-07-26T10:13:37Z","is_enabled":true},"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Describe the Bug with repro steps \n\nI am not sure how to MAKE this happen, however it occurs when a workflow or flow has a filter action that uses a 'does not contain' condition (`not(contains())`) as the main filter and the user does NOT do anything to change that action. It just changes itself.\n\n### What type of Logic App Is this happening in? \n\nConsumption (Portal)\n\n### Which operating system are you using? \n\nWindows\n\n### Did you refer to the TSG before filing this issue? [https://aka.ms/lauxtsg](<https://aka.ms/lauxtsg>) \n\nYes\n\n### Workflow JSON \n\n```json\n\n```\n\n### Screenshots or Videos\n\nHere is a link to a user experiencing this on Power Automate:\n\n[https://community.powerplatform.com/forums/thread/details/?threadid=91425803-3806-f011-bae2-7c1e52696149](<https://community.powerplatform.com/forums/thread/details/?threadid=91425803-3806-f011-bae2-7c1e52696149>)\n\nI am experiencing it on business critical logic apps.\n\n### Browser\n\nChrome/Firefox/Edge\n\n### Additional context\n\nThe GUI should only affect changes that the user tells it to change … this is inherently not good … plus, now, users are being forced to use the new GUI, whether they like it or not.","closed_by":{"login":"Eric-B-Wu","id":95886809,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbcd2Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95886809?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eric-B-Wu","html_url":"https://github.com/Eric-B-Wu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eric-B-Wu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eric-B-Wu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eric-B-Wu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eric-B-Wu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eric-B-Wu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eric-B-Wu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eric-B-Wu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eric-B-Wu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eric-B-Wu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Azure/LogicAppsUX/issues/6851/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Azure/LogicAppsUX/issues/6851/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}